    "geographic": "Jurisdiction enforcement (allowedJurisdictionsOnly fail-closed, blockedJurisdictions).",
    "credentialIntegrity": "Delegation credential validity: proof verification (eddsa-jcs-2022 only), expiry, not-yet-valid, revocation (BitstringStatusList, refresh-first cache-then-deny), issuer pin, schema allowlist, assertionMethod membership, legacy proof suite rejection, agent DID pin, staleness window.",
