    "operationClassification": "Benign operation classification: requestClose, non-voucher typed data allowed; signMessage default-denied unless opted in; ComputeBudget treated as benign.",
    "presentation": "L402 holder-bound VP verification: challenge binding, bearer token rejection, subject/holder DID match, tamper detection via credential proof.",
    "configuration": "Configuration validation: missing policy_config, missing issuerDid, malformed stdin, audit log integrity."
